flowchart TD
  S(( )) --> A[Producer opens product management interface or bulk-import facility]
  A --> B{Creation method?}
  B -- Individual --> C1[Producer enters name, price and producer]
  C1 --> C2[Producer optionally enters category, contents, description]
  C2 --> C3[System validates mandatory fields, description and price format]
  C3 --> C4{Input valid?}
  C4 -- No --> C5[Show validation errors]
  C5 --> C1
  C4 -- Yes --> G
  B -- Bulk import --> D1[Producer submits file or data set with multiple records]
  D1 --> D2[System validates each record: mandatory fields, description, price format, duplicates]
  D2 --> D3[System separates valid and invalid records]
  D3 --> D4[Report validation errors per import policy]
  D4 --> D5{Any valid records?}
  D5 -- No --> Z
  D5 -- Yes --> G[Submit valid product data to backend]
  G --> H[Backend saves products]
  H --> I{Save successful?}
  I -- No --> J[Report failure to producer]
  J --> Z
  I -- Yes --> K[Confirm successful creation]
  K --> L[Producer or customer checks catalogue]
  L --> M{Products found with correct information?}
  M -- Yes --> Z
  M -- No --> N[Report inconsistency between saved products and catalogue]
  N --> Z(((End)))
  style S fill:#000,stroke:#000
  style Z fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-width:3px
